# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LDK Sales Certification — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your Supabase project values.
# Find these in: Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Setup checklist:
# 1. Create a Supabase project at https://supabase.com
# 2. In Dashboard → Authentication → Settings:
#    - Disable "Enable email confirmations" (internal tool, no email verification needed)
#    - Add your production domain to "Site URL"
# 3. In Dashboard → SQL Editor: run supabase/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql
# 4. To make yourself admin: run in SQL Editor:
#    UPDATE public.users SET is_admin = true WHERE email = 'your@ldk.lat';
# 5. Copy .env.example to .env and fill in the values above
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
